  m_text: "Message Board:\n\n11/02/2022\nYou have (1) new response(s) \nGood for
    you! \n\nBecause you are getting more responses we are going to have to charge
    an additional $7.59/month to your monthly fee. \n\nWe wish you the best of luck
    on your interview and hope that you don't have to come back to us. \n\nBut you
    know what they say... they always come back.\n\n\n10/18/2022\nYou have (0) new
    response(s) \nBad for you!\n\n\n10/12/2022\nThis message is being sent to all
    Basic Tier members, there'll be a price increase of $2.33/month to your monthly
    fee. \nThank you for choosing Jobsticle!\n\n\n10/06/2022\nWelcome to Jobsticle.
    Enjoy.\n\nMessages Found In Your Email Pertaining to Jobsticle:\n\n05/23/2022\nHey.
    You should consider joining Jobsticle. Please.\n\n\n05/23/2021\nHey. You should
    consider joining Jobsticle. Please.\n\n\n05/23/2020\nHey. *cough* You should
    consider joining Jobsticle. Please.\n\n\n05/23/2019\nHey. You should consider
    joining Jobsticle. Please.\n\n\n\nJobsticle is a TRADEMARKED name and cannot
    be used in anything (2022)\n\n                                                        
    stop that now\n\n\n\n                                           real nice"
