  textComponent: {fileID: 614575286}
  lines:
  - Hello, before you begin playing my game I'd like to <color=red>disclose</color>
    some things about it first.
  - This is based on a true event that my <color=orange>girlfriend</color> experienced.
  - "Some minor creative liberties were taken to make the story more cohesive and
    fill in some gaps that she couldn\u2019t quite explain."
  - "The story will be told from <color=orange>her</color> perspective but there\u2019ll
    be some breaks in the story where I\u2019ll pop back in to explain some things."
  - I hope you enjoy :)
  textSpeed: 0.02
  sceneName: MainMenu
